</script> <div class="mc-column content-text active-extra-styles " data-block-type="unstyled" data-block-weight="4"> <p class=" content-text__container " data-track-category="Link no Texto" data-track-links> <strong>O Meu Primeiro Gradiente</strong><br> </p> </div> <div class="mc-read-more-wrapper" id="mc-read-more-wrapper"> <button class="mc-read-more-btn theme-color-primary" id="mc-read-more-btn"> Continuar lendo </button> </div> <div class="wall protected-content"> <div class="cropped-block"> <div class="row medium-uncollapsed content-media content-photo" data-block-type="backstage-photo"> <div class="mc-column content-media__container"> <div class="content-media-container"> <figure class="content-media__figure"> <img class="content-media__image" srcset="https://s2-techtudo.glbimg.com/rHsVH88ZoDEtP38SOr9fk9x8fQ4=/0x0:695x639/1000x0/smart/filters:strip_icc()/i.s3.glbimg.com/v1/AUTH_08fbf48bc0524877943fe86e43087e7a/internal_photos/bs/2021/U/9/2Zb71DTNAkom82hkYs1g/2015-09-28-meu-primeiro-gradiente-agora-suporta-mp3.jpg 1000w, https://s2-techtudo.glbimg.com/nHC4kf9oFVtNsbPgXUosK40igxo=/0x0:695x639/984x0/smart/filters:strip_icc()/i.s3.glbimg.com/v1/AUTH_08fbf48bc0524877943fe86e43087e7a/internal_photos/bs/2021/U/9/2Zb71DTNAkom82hkYs1g/2015-09-28-meu-primeiro-gradiente-agora-suporta-mp3.jpg 984w, https://s2-techtudo.glbimg.com/W2nn21xnobFHtBQjr8VoNpjmG30=/0x0:695x639/640x0/smart/filters:strip_icc()/i.s3.glbimg.com/v1/AUTH_08fbf48bc0524877943fe86e43087e7a/internal_photos/bs/2021/U/9/2Zb71DTNAkom82hkYs1g/2015-09-28-meu-primeiro-gradiente-agora-suporta-mp3.jpg 640w, https://s2-techtudo.glbimg.com/UNTvGku07P5rrzNiMCV_1kik0-c=/0x0:695x639/600x0/smart/filters:strip_icc()/i.s3.glbimg.com/v1/AUTH_08fbf48bc0524877943fe86e43087e7a/internal_photos/bs/2021/U/9/2Zb71DTNAkom82hkYs1g/2015-09-28-meu-primeiro-gradiente-agora-suporta-mp3.jpg 600w" src="https://s2-techtudo.glbimg.com/nHC4kf9oFVtNsbPgXUosK40igxo=/0x0:695x639/984x0/smart/filters:strip_icc()/i.s3.glbimg.com/v1/AUTH_08fbf48bc0524877943fe86e43087e7a/internal_photos/bs/2021/U/9/2Zb71DTNAkom82hkYs1g/2015-09-28-meu-primeiro-gradiente-agora-suporta-mp3.jpg" alt="Meu Primeiro Gradiente agora suporta MP3 (Foto: Divulgação) — Foto: TechTudo" width="695" height="639" loading="lazy"> <figcaption class="content-media__description"> Meu Primeiro Gradiente agora suporta MP3 (Foto: Divulgação) — Foto: TechTudo </figcaption> </figure> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="cropped-block"> <div class="mc-column content-text active-extra-styles " data-block-type="unstyled" data-block-weight="111"> <p class=" content-text__container " data-track-category="Link no Texto" data-track-links> O design continua o mesmo, mas as funções… O Meu Primeiro Gradiente era objeto de desejo das crianças nas décadas de 1980 e 1990. A primeira versão do brinquedo vinha com entrada para fita cassete, botões de controle pausa, avançar, parar e retroceder e um microfone. Agora a versão high-tech possui display de LCD, entradas USB para pendrive (vem acompanhado de um com 8 cantigas) e um microfone e rádio FM. Além disso, é compatível com MP3, possui entradas para fones de ouvido e conector mini USB e cabo para conectar a computadores e transferir as gravações. A memória interna é de 128 MB para gravação e 512 MB para pendrive.<br> </p> </div> </div> <div class="cropped-block"> <div class="mc-column content-text active-extra-styles " data-block-type="unstyled" data-block-weight="61"> <p class=" content-text__container " data-track-category="Link no Texto" data-track-links> O brinquedo permite gravar músicas, ouvir e cantar com rádio FM e até criar efeitos de voz. As crianças também podem cantar em dupla, pois possui entrada para dois microfones. E ainda é possível tirar a voz do cantor para gravar a sua voz junto somente com a melodia. O brinquedo funciona alimentação de 6 pilhas AA ou em fonte de energia.<br> </p> </div> </div> <div class="cropped-block"> <div class="mc-column content-text active-extra-styles " data-block-type="unstyled" data-block-weight="3"> <p class=" content-text__container " data-track-category="Link no Texto" data-track-links> <strong>Gradiente MPG 2C</strong><br> </p> </div> </div> <div class="cropped-block"> <div class="row medium-uncollapsed content-media content-photo" data-block-type="backstage-photo"> <div class="mc-column content-media__container"> <div class="content-media-container"> <figure class="content-media__figure"> <img class="content-media__image" srcset="https://s2-techtudo.glbimg.com/BqaoEEV74DyC01V9rk7Q1z1GaIc=/0x0:695x463/1000x0/smart/filters:strip_icc()/i.s3.glbimg.com/v1/AUTH_08fbf48bc0524877943fe86e43087e7a/internal_photos/bs/2021/6/0/lAmTo4RSOOSIlxmjOMPg/2015-09-28-camera-mpg-2c-da-gradiente-vista-de-frente-foto-stella-dauer.jpg 1000w, https://s2-techtudo.glbimg.com/2mSgAlMAiSxGBPQmriUc4mcfdiU=/0x0:695x463/984x0/smart/filters:strip_icc()/i.s3.glbimg.com/v1/AUTH_08fbf48bc0524877943fe86e43087e7a/internal_photos/bs/2021/6/0/lAmTo4RSOOSIlxmjOMPg/2015-09-28-camera-mpg-2c-da-gradiente-vista-de-frente-foto-stella-dauer.jpg 984w, https://s2-techtudo.glbimg.com/fAWTycYMtwWzpyO9TqpvWkPNWdY=/0x0:695x463/640x0/smart/filters:strip_icc()/i.s3.glbimg.com/v1/AUTH_08fbf48bc0524877943fe86e43087e7a/internal_photos/bs/2021/6/0/lAmTo4RSOOSIlxmjOMPg/2015-09-28-camera-mpg-2c-da-gradiente-vista-de-frente-foto-stella-dauer.jpg 640w, https://s2-techtudo.glbimg.com/rRyE8hrcbAd0_TfIGgH_tl1funU=/0x0:695x463/600x0/smart/filters:strip_icc()/i.s3.glbimg.com/v1/AUTH_08fbf48bc0524877943fe86e43087e7a/internal_photos/bs/2021/6/0/lAmTo4RSOOSIlxmjOMPg/2015-09-28-camera-mpg-2c-da-gradiente-vista-de-frente-foto-stella-dauer.jpg 600w" src="https://s2-techtudo.glbimg.com/2mSgAlMAiSxGBPQmriUc4mcfdiU=/0x0:695x463/984x0/smart/filters:strip_icc()/i.s3.glbimg.com/v1/AUTH_08fbf48bc0524877943fe86e43087e7a/internal_photos/bs/2021/6/0/lAmTo4RSOOSIlxmjOMPg/2015-09-28-camera-mpg-2c-da-gradiente-vista-de-frente-foto-stella-dauer.jpg" alt="Câmera MPG 2C da Gradiente (Foto: Stella Dauer) — Foto: TechTudo" width="695" height="463" loading="lazy"> <figcaption class="content-media__description"> Câmera MPG 2C da Gradiente (Foto: Stella Dauer) — Foto: TechTudo </figcaption> </figure> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="cropped-block"> <div class="content-ads content-ads--reveal" data-block-type="ads"> <div data-id="banner_materia2" class="tag-manager-publicidade-container mc-has-reveal mc-has-ad-lazyload"> </div> </div> </div> <div class="cropped-block"> <div class="mc-column content-text active-extra-styles " data-block-type="unstyled" data-block-weight="64"> <p class=" content-text__container " data-track-category="Link no Texto" data-track-links> Aproveitando o enorme sucesso do gravador, a Gradiente lançou a câmera <a class href="http://www.techtudo.com.br/review/gradiente-mpg-2c.html">MPG 2C</a>. Colorida e com sensor de apenas 2 megapixels, o brinquedo é ideal para os pequenos fotógrafos. Além disso, é possível gravar vídeos com áudio em formato AVI de 320 x 240 pixels. A câmera também oferece ferramentas para edição de imagens, como molduras, carimbos, cortar, distorção de rosto e até jogos!<br> </p> </div> </div> <div class="cropped-block"> <div class="mc-column content-text active-extra-styles " data-block-type="unstyled" data-block-weight="52"> <p class=" content-text__container " data-track-category="Link no Texto" data-track-links> O brinquedo funciona com pilhas AA, a memória interna é de 256 MB e possui entrada para cartões de memória de até 16 GB. A MPG 2C vem acompanhada de um cabo áudio e vídeo para exibição das imagens na TV e um cabo USB para transferir as fotos para o computador.<br> </p> </div> </div> <div class="cropped-block"> <div class="mc-column content-text active-extra-styles " data-block-type="unstyled" data-block-weight="1"> <p class=" content-text__container " data-track-category="Link no Texto" data-track-links> <strong>Genius</strong><br> </p> </div> </div> <div class="cropped-block"> <div class="row medium-uncollapsed content-media content-photo" data-block-type="backstage-photo"> <div class="mc-column content-media__container"> <div class="content-media-container"> <figure class="content-media__figure"> <img class="content-media__image" srcset="https://s2-techtudo.glbimg.com/mgbTOCsOg73wH3x1uYkfbGgjiYU=/0x0:695x557/1000x0/smart/filters:strip_icc()/i.s3.glbimg.com/v1/AUTH_08fbf48bc0524877943fe86e43087e7a/internal_photos/bs/2021/e/i/HnJWBWTFSzKQtQmNcw2w/2015-09-28-genius.png 1000w, https://s2-techtudo.glbimg.com/CqPdgBp4jqKe6vdiQpe4RxjWCMg=/0x0:695x557/984x0/smart/filters:strip_icc()/i.s3.glbimg.com/v1/AUTH_08fbf48bc0524877943fe86e43087e7a/internal_photos/bs/2021/e/i/HnJWBWTFSzKQtQmNcw2w/2015-09-28-genius.png 984w, https://s2-techtudo.glbimg.com/AxCsLDlqmFlTsNSBroO44LCZTJA=/0x0:695x557/640x0/smart/filters:strip_icc()/i.s3.glbimg.com/v1/AUTH_08fbf48bc0524877943fe86e43087e7a/internal_photos/bs/2021/e/i/HnJWBWTFSzKQtQmNcw2w/2015-09-28-genius.png 640w, https://s2-techtudo.glbimg.com/pSPTEX_mrfcjD94tsK_Pctv4gIc=/0x0:695x557/600x0/smart/filters:strip_icc()/i.s3.glbimg.com/v1/AUTH_08fbf48bc0524877943fe86e43087e7a/internal_photos/bs/2021/e/i/HnJWBWTFSzKQtQmNcw2w/2015-09-28-genius.png 600w" src="https://s2-techtudo.glbimg.com/CqPdgBp4jqKe6vdiQpe4RxjWCMg=/0x0:695x557/984x0/smart/filters:strip_icc()/i.s3.glbimg.com/v1/AUTH_08fbf48bc0524877943fe86e43087e7a/internal_photos/bs/2021/e/i/HnJWBWTFSzKQtQmNcw2w/2015-09-28-genius.png" alt="Genius:o computador que brinca (Foto: Divulgação) — Foto: TechTudo" width="695" height="557" loading="lazy"> <figcaption class="content-media__description"> Genius:o computador que brinca (Foto: Divulgação) — Foto: TechTudo </figcaption> </figure> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="cropped-block"> <div class="mc-column content-text active-extra-styles " data-block-type="unstyled" data-block-weight="81"> <p class=" content-text__container " data-track-category="Link no Texto" data-track-links> O <a class href="http://www.techtudo.com.br/tudo-sobre/genius-media.html">Genius</a> foi o primeiro brinquedo eletrônico comercializado no Brasil. Chamado de “o computador que brinca”, virou febre entre as crianças nos anos 1980 e agora ele está de volta! Com um design repaginado, mas sem fugir do tradicional formato de disco, ele emite sons e acende os painéis de cor e o jogador tem que repetir a sequência dada pelo brinquedo sem errar. São três jogos diferentes e quatro níveis de dificuldade. Uma competição divertida para quem tem boa memória.<br><br> </p> </div> </div> <div class="cropped-block"> <div class="mc-column content-text active-extra-styles " data-block-type="unstyled" data-block-weight="1"> <p class=" content-text__container " data-track-category="Link no Texto" data-track-links> <strong>Perfil</strong><br> </p> </div> </div> <div class="cropped-block"> <div class="row medium-uncollapsed content-media content-photo" data-block-type="backstage-photo"> <div class="mc-column content-media__container"> <div class="content-media-container"> <figure class="content-media__figure"> <img class="content-media__image" srcset="https://s2-techtudo.glbimg.com/aV9r4s3PmkCuaszWQT15hWY947M=/0x0:695x490/1000x0/smart/filters:strip_icc()/i.s3.glbimg.com/v1/AUTH_08fbf48bc0524877943fe86e43087e7a/internal_photos/bs/2021/R/n/gAEE9UQ0y2UDTO7DfmFg/2015-09-28-perfil.jpg 1000w, https://s2-techtudo.glbimg.com/_S18NgCbCMrAz4m3zn85EGK_Zn4=/0x0:695x490/984x0/smart/filters:strip_icc()/i.s3.glbimg.com/v1/AUTH_08fbf48bc0524877943fe86e43087e7a/internal_photos/bs/2021/R/n/gAEE9UQ0y2UDTO7DfmFg/2015-09-28-perfil.jpg 984w, https://s2-techtudo.glbimg.com/HLD0gqLxKgnEmcovRLX9mDUAniA=/0x0:695x490/640x0/smart/filters:strip_icc()/i.s3.glbimg.com/v1/AUTH_08fbf48bc0524877943fe86e43087e7a/internal_photos/bs/2021/R/n/gAEE9UQ0y2UDTO7DfmFg/2015-09-28-perfil.jpg 640w, https://s2-techtudo.glbimg.com/Nb7Lhpj88pJoxDn3x7-2ve9CuoA=/0x0:695x490/600x0/smart/filters:strip_icc()/i.s3.glbimg.com/v1/AUTH_08fbf48bc0524877943fe86e43087e7a/internal_photos/bs/2021/R/n/gAEE9UQ0y2UDTO7DfmFg/2015-09-28-perfil.jpg 600w" src="https://s2-techtudo.glbimg.com/_S18NgCbCMrAz4m3zn85EGK_Zn4=/0x0:695x490/984x0/smart/filters:strip_icc()/i.s3.glbimg.com/v1/AUTH_08fbf48bc0524877943fe86e43087e7a/internal_photos/bs/2021/R/n/gAEE9UQ0y2UDTO7DfmFg/2015-09-28-perfil.jpg" alt="O jogo de tabuleiro Perfil agora é aplicativo (Foto: Divulgação) — Foto: TechTudo" width="695" height="490" loading="lazy"> <figcaption class="content-media__description"> O jogo de tabuleiro Perfil agora é aplicativo (Foto: Divulgação) — Foto: TechTudo </figcaption> </figure> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="cropped-block"> <div class="content-ads content-ads--reveal" data-block-type="ads"> <div data-id="banner_materia__5506a8c2-fe3a-4dde-bc92-d34f4dfe2fe7" class="tag-manager-publicidade-container mc-has-reveal mc-has-ad-lazyload"> </div> </div> </div> <div class="cropped-block"> <div class="mc-column content-text active-extra-styles " data-block-type="unstyled" data-block-weight="68"> <p class=" content-text__container " data-track-category="Link no Texto" data-track-links> Saudades dos jogos de tabuleiro? Quem se lembra do <a class href="http://www.techtudo.com.br/tudo-sobre/perfil.html">Perfil</a> vai adorar saber que agora existe uma versão digital gratuita para dispositivos móveis <a class href="http://www.techtudo.com.br/tudo-sobre/android.html">Android</a>, <a class href="http://www.techtudo.com.br/tudo-sobre/ios.html">iOS</a> e <a class href="http://www.techtudo.com.br/tudo-sobre/windows-phone.html">Windows Phone</a>. Com opção de jogar sozinho ou em turma, como antigamente, o jogo da Crow traz charadas sobre um lugar, coisa, pessoa ou ano. O aplicativo tem exatamente as mesmas regras do jogo de tabuleiro e traz versão gratuita e pagas.<br> </p> </div> </div> <div class="cropped-block"> <div class="mc-column content-text active-extra-styles " data-block-type="unstyled" data-block-weight="2"> <p class=" content-text__container " data-track-category="Link no Texto" data-track-links> <strong>Master System</strong><br> </p> </div> </div> <div class="cropped-block"> <div class="row medium-uncollapsed content-media content-photo" data-block-type="backstage-photo"> <div class="mc-column content-media__container"> <div class="content-media-container"> <figure class="content-media__figure"> <img class="content-media__image" srcset="https://s2-techtudo.glbimg.com/NzDJwIiaw_nDXsz_vdqormby8cs=/0x0:695x617/1000x0/smart/filters:strip_icc()/i.s3.glbimg.com/v1/AUTH_08fbf48bc0524877943fe86e43087e7a/internal_photos/bs/2021/x/g/BepAWMRpqAxmE9OZ4saA/2015-09-28-master-system.png 1000w, https://s2-techtudo.glbimg.com/bAUa4YHxT3tyPBwwFtEX0w5wZMw=/0x0:695x617/984x0/smart/filters:strip_icc()/i.s3.glbimg.com/v1/AUTH_08fbf48bc0524877943fe86e43087e7a/internal_photos/bs/2021/x/g/BepAWMRpqAxmE9OZ4saA/2015-09-28-master-system.png 984w, https://s2-techtudo.glbimg.com/XCpiUkYLV7aiVnR4LiOMa2v94KI=/0x0:695x617/640x0/smart/filters:strip_icc()/i.s3.glbimg.com/v1/AUTH_08fbf48bc0524877943fe86e43087e7a/internal_photos/bs/2021/x/g/BepAWMRpqAxmE9OZ4saA/2015-09-28-master-system.png 640w, https://s2-techtudo.glbimg.com/bF1M8MQTqwp_SIZ3rMJVkoRDWp4=/0x0:695x617/600x0/smart/filters:strip_icc()/i.s3.glbimg.com/v1/AUTH_08fbf48bc0524877943fe86e43087e7a/internal_photos/bs/2021/x/g/BepAWMRpqAxmE9OZ4saA/2015-09-28-master-system.png 600w" src="https://s2-techtudo.glbimg.com/bAUa4YHxT3tyPBwwFtEX0w5wZMw=/0x0:695x617/984x0/smart/filters:strip_icc()/i.s3.glbimg.com/v1/AUTH_08fbf48bc0524877943fe86e43087e7a/internal_photos/bs/2021/x/g/BepAWMRpqAxmE9OZ4saA/2015-09-28-master-system.png" alt="Sucesso nos anos 90, o Master System está de volta (Foto: Divulgação) — Foto: TechTudo" width="695" height="617" loading="lazy"> <figcaption class="content-media__description"> Sucesso nos anos 90, o Master System está de volta (Foto: Divulgação) — Foto: TechTudo </figcaption> </figure> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="cropped-block"> <div class="mc-column content-text active-extra-styles " data-block-type="unstyled" data-block-weight="37"> <p class=" content-text__container " data-track-category="Link no Texto" data-track-links> O Master System ataca novamente! A nova versão do videogame apresenta um design moderno e atraente, mas sem esquecer o tradicional tom azul escuro e a estampa do memorável porco-espinho Sonic no console com dois joysticks ergonômicos.<br><br> </p> </div> </div> <div class="cropped-block"> <div class="mc-column content-text active-extra-styles " data-block-type="unstyled" data-block-weight="35"> <p class=" content-text__container " data-track-category="Link no Texto" data-track-links> Esqueça os antigos cartuchos de jogos, o <a class href="http://www.techtudo.com.br/tudo-sobre/master-system-evolution.html">Master System Evolution</a> conta com 132 jogos com classificação livre na memória incluindo os clássicos como <a class href="http://www.techtudo.com.br/tudo-sobre/alex-kidd-is-back.html">Alex Kidd</a> , <a class href="http://www.techtudo.com.br/tudo-sobre/sonic-the-hedgehog.html">Sonic the Hedgehog</a>, Axe, Hang On e <a class href="http://www.techtudo.com.br/tudo-sobre/altered-beast.html">Altered Beast</a>.<br> </p> </div> </div> <div class="cropped-block"> <div class="mc-column content-text active-extra-styles " data-block-type="unstyled" data-block-weight="2"> <p class=" content-text__container " data-track-category="Link no Texto" data-track-links> <strong>Mega Drive</strong><br> </p> </div> </div> <div class="cropped-block"> <div class="row medium-uncollapsed content-media content-photo" data-block-type="backstage-photo"> <div class="mc-column content-media__container"> <div class="content-media-container"> <figure class="content-media__figure"> <img class="content-media__image" srcset="https://s2-techtudo.glbimg.com/0A5irpwYYkYCD2P55MnXIb7rWhY=/0x0:695x590/1000x0/smart/filters:strip_icc()/i.s3.glbimg.com/v1/AUTH_08fbf48bc0524877943fe86e43087e7a/internal_photos/bs/2021/2/H/o1PRiqQyAcTuUGAm0jAw/2015-09-28-mega-drive.jpg 1000w, https://s2-techtudo.glbimg.com/lu6oyoHBixqY90Bsdp1fYVZ9Olk=/0x0:695x590/984x0/smart/filters:strip_icc()/i.s3.glbimg.com/v1/AUTH_08fbf48bc0524877943fe86e43087e7a/internal_photos/bs/2021/2/H/o1PRiqQyAcTuUGAm0jAw/2015-09-28-mega-drive.jpg 984w, https://s2-techtudo.glbimg.com/y_Fv1KKp9r9-9JIoL76orzvP3Zs=/0x0:695x590/640x0/smart/filters:strip_icc()/i.s3.glbimg.com/v1/AUTH_08fbf48bc0524877943fe86e43087e7a/internal_photos/bs/2021/2/H/o1PRiqQyAcTuUGAm0jAw/2015-09-28-mega-drive.jpg 640w, https://s2-techtudo.glbimg.com/ZfAwLJjjsPm7Yf0EJTxLuMzyL_s=/0x0:695x590/600x0/smart/filters:strip_icc()/i.s3.glbimg.com/v1/AUTH_08fbf48bc0524877943fe86e43087e7a/internal_photos/bs/2021/2/H/o1PRiqQyAcTuUGAm0jAw/2015-09-28-mega-drive.jpg 600w" src="https://s2-techtudo.glbimg.com/lu6oyoHBixqY90Bsdp1fYVZ9Olk=/0x0:695x590/984x0/smart/filters:strip_icc()/i.s3.glbimg.com/v1/AUTH_08fbf48bc0524877943fe86e43087e7a/internal_photos/bs/2021/2/H/o1PRiqQyAcTuUGAm0jAw/2015-09-28-mega-drive.jpg" alt="Mega Drive agora é um videogame portátil (Foto: Divulgação) — Foto: TechTudo" width="695" height="590" loading="lazy"> <figcaption class="content-media__description"> Mega Drive agora é um videogame portátil (Foto: Divulgação) — Foto: TechTudo </figcaption> </figure> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="cropped-block"> <div class="content-ads content-ads--reveal" data-block-type="ads"> <div data-id="banner_materia__3e96869e-edda-49bc-8f0e-bc0be916c46f" class="tag-manager-publicidade-container mc-has-reveal mc-has-ad-lazyload"> </div> </div> </div> <div class="cropped-block"> <div class="mc-column content-text active-extra-styles " data-block-type="unstyled" data-block-weight="62"> <p class=" content-text__container " data-track-category="Link no Texto" data-track-links> O Mega Drive voltou em versão portátil. O videogame foi sucesso há mais de 20 anos e volta para fazer a alegria das crianças e dos adultos de hoje. São 20 jogos na memória incluindo os clássicos, como o <a class href="http://www.techtudo.com.br/tudo-sobre/sonic-hedgehog-2.html">Sonic</a>, California Games, <a class href="http://www.techtudo.com.br/tudo-sobre/castle-illusion.html">Castle of Illusion</a> e <a class href="http://www.techtudo.com.br/tudo-sobre/mortal-kombat.html">Mortal Kombat</a>. E ainda conta com entrada para o MD CARD GAME para jogar mais jogos.<br> </p> </div> </div> <div class="cropped-block"> <div class="mc-column content-text active-extra-styles " data-block-type="unstyled" data-block-weight="32"> <p class=" content-text__container " data-track-category="Link no Texto" data-track-links> O game tem tela de LCD de 2,8 polegadas e bateria interna recarregável com, aproximadamente, 5 horas de duração. Acompanhado de um cabo de áudio e vídeo é possível jogar na TV.<br> </p> </div> </div> <div class="cropped-block"> <div class="mc-column content-text active-extra-styles " data-block-type="unstyled" data-block-weight="1"> <p class=" content-text__container " data-track-category="Link no Texto" data-track-links> <strong>Furby</strong><br> </p> </div> </div> <div class="cropped-block"> <div class="row medium-uncollapsed content-media content-photo" data-block-type="backstage-photo"> <div class="mc-column content-media__container"> <div class="content-media-container"> <figure class="content-media__figure"> <img class="content-media__image" srcset="https://s2-techtudo.glbimg.com/yCC1rrb328TE4DBywEcysyIow0c=/0x0:695x695/1000x0/smart/filters:strip_icc()/i.s3.glbimg.com/v1/AUTH_08fbf48bc0524877943fe86e43087e7a/internal_photos/bs/2021/4/q/NmE5uJRqeP2xmMakbsMQ/2015-09-28-furby.jpg 1000w, https://s2-techtudo.glbimg.com/T5rjMG-yICsAVBjx-pSCL6cmSUs=/0x0:695x695/984x0/smart/filters:strip_icc()/i.s3.glbimg.com/v1/AUTH_08fbf48bc0524877943fe86e43087e7a/internal_photos/bs/2021/4/q/NmE5uJRqeP2xmMakbsMQ/2015-09-28-furby.jpg 984w, https://s2-techtudo.glbimg.com/fBcOFSwGja-KNMGkf1Rg2UTJkoE=/0x0:695x695/640x0/smart/filters:strip_icc()/i.s3.glbimg.com/v1/AUTH_08fbf48bc0524877943fe86e43087e7a/internal_photos/bs/2021/4/q/NmE5uJRqeP2xmMakbsMQ/2015-09-28-furby.jpg 640w, https://s2-techtudo.glbimg.com/X5I99pAL2AfnwopsbYkCqiC8gEw=/0x0:695x695/600x0/smart/filters:strip_icc()/i.s3.glbimg.com/v1/AUTH_08fbf48bc0524877943fe86e43087e7a/internal_photos/bs/2021/4/q/NmE5uJRqeP2xmMakbsMQ/2015-09-28-furby.jpg 600w" src="https://s2-techtudo.glbimg.com/T5rjMG-yICsAVBjx-pSCL6cmSUs=/0x0:695x695/984x0/smart/filters:strip_icc()/i.s3.glbimg.com/v1/AUTH_08fbf48bc0524877943fe86e43087e7a/internal_photos/bs/2021/4/q/NmE5uJRqeP2xmMakbsMQ/2015-09-28-furby.jpg" alt="O Furby voltou com visual repaginado e com novas cores (Foto: Divulgação) — Foto: TechTudo" width="695" height="695" loading="lazy"> <figcaption class="content-media__description"> O Furby voltou com visual repaginado e com novas cores (Foto: Divulgação) — Foto: TechTudo </figcaption> </figure> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="cropped-block"> <div class="mc-column content-text active-extra-styles " data-block-type="unstyled" data-block-weight="86"> <p class=" content-text__container " data-track-category="Link no Texto" data-track-links> O <a class href="http://www.techtudo.com.br/tudo-sobre/furby.html">Furby</a> foi lançado no final da década de 1980 e foi sucesso de vendas. O brinquedo eletrônico é um “robô fofo” que interage com as crianças. A nova versão vem com um aplicativo para os pequenos cuidarem do seu Furby: dando comida, banho, fazendo cócegas e brincando e jogando com ele. E ainda, o <a class href="http://www.techtudo.com.br/tudo-sobre/furby-boom.html">Furby Boom</a> pode criar ovos! Choque-o para nascer um Furbling, uma pequena e divertida criaturinha virtual. Além da cor tradicional azul, o brinquedo está disponível em outras diversas cores e estampas.<br> </p> </div> </div> <div class="cropped-block"> <div class="mc-column content-text active-extra-styles " data-block-type="unstyled" data-block-weight="1"> <p class=" content-text__container " data-track-category="Link no Texto" data-track-links> <strong>Tamagotchi</strong><br> </p> </div> </div> <div class="cropped-block"> <div class="row medium-uncollapsed content-media content-photo" data-block-type="backstage-photo"> <div class="mc-column content-media__container"> <div class="content-media-container"> <figure class="content-media__figure"> <img class="content-media__image" srcset="https://s2-techtudo.glbimg.com/6Dgdmj-FPrQRdN0nt3p2DgrrKNU=/0x0:695x570/1000x0/smart/filters:strip_icc()/i.s3.glbimg.com/v1/AUTH_08fbf48bc0524877943fe86e43087e7a/internal_photos/bs/2021/b/f/XzDUO4RBG9GJ4TTSVhxQ/2015-09-28-tamagotchi.png 1000w, https://s2-techtudo.glbimg.com/TGTvlXMFRkadb6KAXF-QnGEppY8=/0x0:695x570/984x0/smart/filters:strip_icc()/i.s3.glbimg.com/v1/AUTH_08fbf48bc0524877943fe86e43087e7a/internal_photos/bs/2021/b/f/XzDUO4RBG9GJ4TTSVhxQ/2015-09-28-tamagotchi.png 984w, https://s2-techtudo.glbimg.com/jp1gm15l8PGQZvNJQ2GdOTHVj38=/0x0:695x570/640x0/smart/filters:strip_icc()/i.s3.glbimg.com/v1/AUTH_08fbf48bc0524877943fe86e43087e7a/internal_photos/bs/2021/b/f/XzDUO4RBG9GJ4TTSVhxQ/2015-09-28-tamagotchi.png 640w, https://s2-techtudo.glbimg.com/1Lmh60ivcfkSjxkESUrtMqGoxkE=/0x0:695x570/600x0/smart/filters:strip_icc()/i.s3.glbimg.com/v1/AUTH_08fbf48bc0524877943fe86e43087e7a/internal_photos/bs/2021/b/f/XzDUO4RBG9GJ4TTSVhxQ/2015-09-28-tamagotchi.png 600w" src="https://s2-techtudo.glbimg.com/TGTvlXMFRkadb6KAXF-QnGEppY8=/0x0:695x570/984x0/smart/filters:strip_icc()/i.s3.glbimg.com/v1/AUTH_08fbf48bc0524877943fe86e43087e7a/internal_photos/bs/2021/b/f/XzDUO4RBG9GJ4TTSVhxQ/2015-09-28-tamagotchi.png" alt="O Tamagotchi virou aplicativo (Foto: Divulgação) — Foto: TechTudo" width="695" height="570" loading="lazy"> <figcaption class="content-media__description"> O Tamagotchi virou aplicativo (Foto: Divulgação) — Foto: TechTudo </figcaption> </figure> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="cropped-block"> <div class="content-ads content-ads--reveal" data-block-type="ads"> <div data-id="banner_materia__642e3982-90d0-40bb-affa-e66b8286d3b7" class="tag-manager-publicidade-container mc-has-reveal mc-has-ad-lazyload"> </div> </div> </div> <div class="cropped-block"> <div class="mc-column content-text active-extra-styles " data-block-type="unstyled" data-block-weight="51"> <p class=" content-text__container " data-track-category="Link no Texto" data-track-links> O bichinho virtual que era mania entre as crianças na década de 1990 voltou em forma de aplicativo para <a class href="http://www.techtudo.com.br/tudo-sobre/android.html">Android</a>. O jogo é não deixar o Tamagotchi morrer e para isso é preciso alimentá-lo, dar banho e brincar com ele. E agora, o usuário pode obter templates especiais para o jogo. <br> </p> </div> </div> <div class="cropped-block"> <div class="mc-column content-text active-extra-styles " data-block-type="unstyled" data-block-weight="3"> <p class=" content-text__container " data-track-category="Link no Texto" data-track-links> <strong>Games viraram aplicativos</strong><br> </p> </div> </div> <div class="cropped-block"> <div class="mc-column content-text active-extra-styles " data-block-type="unstyled" data-block-weight="49"> <p class=" content-text__container " data-track-category="Link no Texto" data-track-links> Os jogos clássicos que fizeram a cabeça da garotada também estão de volta. Um deles é o saudoso <a class href="http://www.techtudo.com.br/tudo-sobre/pac-man.html">Pac-Man</a>. Antes jogados nos fliperamas e no <a class href="http://www.techtudo.com.br/tudo-sobre/atari.html">Atari</a> , agora podem ser baixados nos smartphones. O aplicativo do jogo está disponível para Android, <a class href="http://www.techtudo.com.br/tudo-sobre/ios.html">iOS</a> e tem versão até para computador Windows.<br> </p> </div> </div> <div class="cropped-block"> <div class="row medium-uncollapsed content-media content-photo" data-block-type="backstage-photo"> <div class="mc-column content-media__container"> <div class="content-media-container"> <figure class="content-media__figure"> <img class="content-media__image" srcset="https://s2-techtudo.glbimg.com/7qo74daWrkNHJmH-PF0jVTCjIpw=/0x0:695x348/1000x0/smart/filters:strip_icc()/i.s3.glbimg.com/v1/AUTH_08fbf48bc0524877943fe86e43087e7a/internal_photos/bs/2021/e/w/aOFIzJRROAWVLpsVErwQ/2015-09-28-pacman.jpg 1000w, https://s2-techtudo.glbimg.com/HhI2b_UkjC5Hn6kJeTmFK94GMW4=/0x0:695x348/984x0/smart/filters:strip_icc()/i.s3.glbimg.com/v1/AUTH_08fbf48bc0524877943fe86e43087e7a/internal_photos/bs/2021/e/w/aOFIzJRROAWVLpsVErwQ/2015-09-28-pacman.jpg 984w, https://s2-techtudo.glbimg.com/CZ-bGgV9UjEi5RV2vYVgFqHlIhM=/0x0:695x348/640x0/smart/filters:strip_icc()/i.s3.glbimg.com/v1/AUTH_08fbf48bc0524877943fe86e43087e7a/internal_photos/bs/2021/e/w/aOFIzJRROAWVLpsVErwQ/2015-09-28-pacman.jpg 640w, https://s2-techtudo.glbimg.com/AB-YxjFUIqHfaQ5I9yfqy7K0uR8=/0x0:695x348/600x0/smart/filters:strip_icc()/i.s3.glbimg.com/v1/AUTH_08fbf48bc0524877943fe86e43087e7a/internal_photos/bs/2021/e/w/aOFIzJRROAWVLpsVErwQ/2015-09-28-pacman.jpg 600w" src="https://s2-techtudo.glbimg.com/HhI2b_UkjC5Hn6kJeTmFK94GMW4=/0x0:695x348/984x0/smart/filters:strip_icc()/i.s3.glbimg.com/v1/AUTH_08fbf48bc0524877943fe86e43087e7a/internal_photos/bs/2021/e/w/aOFIzJRROAWVLpsVErwQ/2015-09-28-pacman.jpg" alt="O clássico Pac-Man agora no celular (Foto: Divulgação) — Foto: TechTudo" width="695" height="348" loading="lazy"> <figcaption class="content-media__description"> O clássico Pac-Man agora no celular (Foto: Divulgação) — Foto: TechTudo </figcaption> </figure> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="cropped-block"> <div class="mc-column content-text active-extra-styles " data-block-type="unstyled" data-block-weight="26"> <p class=" content-text__container " data-track-category="Link no Texto" data-track-links> Outro jogo clássico do <a class href="http://www.techtudo.com.br/tudo-sobre/atari.html">Atari</a> que voltou em forma de aplicativo é o <a class href="http://www.techtudo.com.br/tudo-sobre/enduro.html">Enduro</a>. Game de 1983, produzido para o Atari, está disponível para Android e iOS.<br> </p> </div> </div> <div class="cropped-block"> <div class="row medium-uncollapsed content-media content-photo" data-block-type="backstage-photo"> <div class="mc-column content-media__container"> <div class="content-media-container"> <figure class="content-media__figure"> <img class="content-media__image" srcset="https://s2-techtudo.glbimg.com/8UyHtxdZsg2bLDJTx5hPMDSB2_Q=/0x0:695x463/1000x0/smart/filters:strip_icc()/i.s3.glbimg.com/v1/AUTH_08fbf48bc0524877943fe86e43087e7a/internal_photos/bs/2021/n/v/xp8x98S7m9SwcEvAW8cw/2015-09-28-enduro.jpg 1000w, https://s2-techtudo.glbimg.com/6MyYY-Vvk3xOYm74N9UqbNySlO4=/0x0:695x463/984x0/smart/filters:strip_icc()/i.s3.glbimg.com/v1/AUTH_08fbf48bc0524877943fe86e43087e7a/internal_photos/bs/2021/n/v/xp8x98S7m9SwcEvAW8cw/2015-09-28-enduro.jpg 984w, https://s2-techtudo.glbimg.com/SqylvucXrxD7mIbogDctfPMNbvo=/0x0:695x463/640x0/smart/filters:strip_icc()/i.s3.glbimg.com/v1/AUTH_08fbf48bc0524877943fe86e43087e7a/internal_photos/bs/2021/n/v/xp8x98S7m9SwcEvAW8cw/2015-09-28-enduro.jpg 640w, https://s2-techtudo.glbimg.com/lsfSFFrbbMqYWK-a1BpdEcwoQfQ=/0x0:695x463/600x0/smart/filters:strip_icc()/i.s3.glbimg.com/v1/AUTH_08fbf48bc0524877943fe86e43087e7a/internal_photos/bs/2021/n/v/xp8x98S7m9SwcEvAW8cw/2015-09-28-enduro.jpg 600w" src="https://s2-techtudo.glbimg.com/6MyYY-Vvk3xOYm74N9UqbNySlO4=/0x0:695x463/984x0/smart/filters:strip_icc()/i.s3.glbimg.com/v1/AUTH_08fbf48bc0524877943fe86e43087e7a/internal_photos/bs/2021/n/v/xp8x98S7m9SwcEvAW8cw/2015-09-28-enduro.jpg" alt="Enduro: jogo de corrida de carros do Atari agora no seu celular (Foto: Divulgação) — Foto: TechTudo" width="695" height="463" loading="lazy"> <figcaption class="content-media__description"> Enduro: jogo de corrida de carros do Atari agora no seu celular (Foto: Divulgação) — Foto: TechTudo </figcaption> </figure> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="cropped-block"> <div class="content-ads content-ads--reveal" data-block-type="ads"> <div data-id="banner_materia__40a754e1-7b44-480b-a74b-ee267899a261" class="tag-manager-publicidade-container mc-has-reveal mc-has-ad-lazyload"> </div> </div> </div> <div class="cropped-block"> <div class="mc-column content-text active-extra-styles " data-block-type="unstyled" data-block-weight="36"> <p class=" content-text__container " data-track-category="Link no Texto" data-track-links> O popular jogo da cobrinha, <a class href="http://www.techtudo.com.br/tudo-sobre/snake-97.html">Snake&#x27;97</a>, presente nos celulares <a class href="http://www.techtudo.com.br/tudo-sobre/nokia.html">Nokia</a> no final da década de 1990 também virou aplicativo. O app desenvolvido pelo mesmo criador da versão antiga está disponível para Android, iOS e <a class href="http://www.techtudo.com.br/tudo-sobre/windows-phone.html">Windows Phone</a>.<br> </p> </div> </div> <div class="cropped-block"> <div class="row medium-uncollapsed content-media content-photo" data-block-type="backstage-photo"> <div class="mc-column content-media__container"> <div class="content-media-container"> <figure class="content-media__figure"> <img class="content-media__image" srcset="https://s2-techtudo.glbimg.com/2J_yo2ddQDVNselpU-kqC__vCnA=/0x0:695x417/1000x0/smart/filters:strip_icc()/i.s3.glbimg.com/v1/AUTH_08fbf48bc0524877943fe86e43087e7a/internal_photos/bs/2021/L/r/iDfUkfQRq2Fqpl1LNMOQ/2015-09-28-snake.jpg 1000w, https://s2-techtudo.glbimg.com/GtdONqJDYfIdSKXssqEvu7ilCIs=/0x0:695x417/984x0/smart/filters:strip_icc()/i.s3.glbimg.com/v1/AUTH_08fbf48bc0524877943fe86e43087e7a/internal_photos/bs/2021/L/r/iDfUkfQRq2Fqpl1LNMOQ/2015-09-28-snake.jpg 984w, https://s2-techtudo.glbimg.com/LJb2v0yoI4vp2QvsUuTxtNNeoeo=/0x0:695x417/640x0/smart/filters:strip_icc()/i.s3.glbimg.com/v1/AUTH_08fbf48bc0524877943fe86e43087e7a/internal_photos/bs/2021/L/r/iDfUkfQRq2Fqpl1LNMOQ/2015-09-28-snake.jpg 640w, https://s2-techtudo.glbimg.com/dMg3KzfBv9p4NToXQChccrS5Kvw=/0x0:695x417/600x0/smart/filters:strip_icc()/i.s3.glbimg.com/v1/AUTH_08fbf48bc0524877943fe86e43087e7a/internal_photos/bs/2021/L/r/iDfUkfQRq2Fqpl1LNMOQ/2015-09-28-snake.jpg 600w" src="https://s2-techtudo.glbimg.com/GtdONqJDYfIdSKXssqEvu7ilCIs=/0x0:695x417/984x0/smart/filters:strip_icc()/i.s3.glbimg.com/v1/AUTH_08fbf48bc0524877943fe86e43087e7a/internal_photos/bs/2021/L/r/iDfUkfQRq2Fqpl1LNMOQ/2015-09-28-snake.jpg" alt="Snake: popular jogo da cobrinha é anunciado para smartphones (Foto: Divulgação) — Foto: TechTudo" width="695" height="417" loading="lazy"> <figcaption class="content-media__description"> Snake: popular jogo da cobrinha é anunciado para smartphones (Foto: Divulgação) — Foto: TechTudo </figcaption> </figure> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="cropped-block"> <div class="mc-column content-text active-extra-styles " data-block-type="unstyled" data-block-weight="36"> <p class=" content-text__container " data-track-category="Link no Texto" data-track-links> O tradicional jogo de lógica e raciocínio <a class href="http://www.techtudo.com.br/tudo-sobre/tetris.html">Tetris</a> também está de volta nos smartphones Android, iOS e Windows Phone. No jogo, o jogador deve empilhar cubos e encaixar em linhas contínuas em uma base sem falhas.<br> </p> </div> </div> <div class="cropped-block"> <div class="row medium-uncollapsed content-media content-photo" data-block-type="backstage-photo"> <div class="mc-column content-media__container"> <div class="content-media-container"> <figure class="content-media__figure"> <img class="content-media__image" srcset="https://s2-techtudo.glbimg.com/JQ5q4XQTtC5SwC5nlnK3yOhds5w=/0x0:695x435/1000x0/smart/filters:strip_icc()/i.s3.glbimg.com/v1/AUTH_08fbf48bc0524877943fe86e43087e7a/internal_photos/bs/2021/B/B/clxv5zQgAJ7N7nBKGXrQ/2015-09-28-tretis.jpg 1000w, https://s2-techtudo.glbimg.com/D3rPRiSRHRsilDCWsn2Gra6lu8A=/0x0:695x435/984x0/smart/filters:strip_icc()/i.s3.glbimg.com/v1/AUTH_08fbf48bc0524877943fe86e43087e7a/internal_photos/bs/2021/B/B/clxv5zQgAJ7N7nBKGXrQ/2015-09-28-tretis.jpg 984w, https://s2-techtudo.glbimg.com/XerlIMmzFSpBne-oa3vh4_4EIPg=/0x0